"\"{gramps_place_type}\". The place was imported, but its type was set to "
"\"{betty_place_type}\"."
msgstr ""
"Betty kent het Gramps-plaatstype \"{gramps_place_type}\" van plaats "
"\"{place_id}\" niet. De plaats is geladen, maar hun type is nu "
"\"{betty_place_type}\"."

#, python-brace-format
